plaintext
Vi 5 6 DC 0 ; Voltage source Vi connected between nodes 5 and 6
RS 5 4 1k ; Resistor RS connected between nodes 5 and 4 (example value 1k)
RP 4 2 1k ; Resistor RP connected between nodes 4 and 2 (example value 1k)
CP 4 3 1u ; Capacitor CP connected between nodes 4 and 3 (example value 1uF)
V0 3 2 DC 0 ; Vo output at node 3 with reference to ground node 2
